cl.missao.idolo.titulo=The idol
cl.missao.idolo.desc=Craft and place a Cursed Idol: 4 gold ingots in the corners, 4 mummy wraps on the sides and chiseled sandstone in the middle. Touch it at night... if you dare.
cl.missao.farao.titulo=The Cursed Pharaoh
cl.missao.farao.desc=Defeat the Cursed Pharaoh. He summons servants, blasts sand and, when hurt, calls the storm.

